OL,3,GNEWSAThe school on a mission to
OL,4,Atransform its menu
OL,5,
OL,6,FA primary school in north Manchester is
OL,7,Fembarking on a year-long project to
OL,8,Ftransform its school meals.
OL,10,FCrab Lane Primary School in Moston is
OL,11,Fone of 10 schools selected to take part
OL,12,Fin a programme aimed at improving food
OL,13,Fquality and food education.
OL,15,FThe initiative, from the School Food
OL,16,FProject, will see professional chefs
OL,17,Fwork with school kitchen staff to
OL,18,Fprovide them with support and extra
OL,19,Ftraining.
